- [stdio and Streamable HTTP transports](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/basic/transports)
- [HTTP authorization](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/basic/authorization)
- [Tools, results, and tool security](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/server/tools)
